governor turn 2: plan -> types, format, storage, commands  (Each rejected test change only renames the field in a fixture or property access, and the request itself requires that. I'm approving all four and reissuing the same plan.)
round 2: owners types=ok format=ok storage=ok commands=ok; oracle GREEN
governor turn 3: accept  (Oracle is green (tsc clean, 16/16 tests). Todo now declares `completed` in place of `done`, and all four units were updated and submitted. The acceptance tests confirm commands create and complete todos using `completed` with no `done` key. ListOptions.includeDone is a separate option name and was intentionally left unchanged.)

